              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafa AABBO Waaqi ibida keesa gaara Sinai irati isaniini dubbate, isani waan isa fakaata tokole ingarre. Tanaafi ira jirti teesaniifi aka dansaa mid'aafad'aa hubad'a, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
