        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo isani worra inni lafa Misiri ta aka boola ibida keesaa baase, haga arrale nama ufi isani tolfate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.20.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hen 20.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maro teesanifi AABBO Waaqi keesani naati dallane kakhate atini galaana Yordani taakite lafa anini worra Israeliti kennu inseentu naani jed'e, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini galaana gama intaaku, lafuma tana keesati dua, ammo isaani taakitani lafa gabbo suniti ya qubachu geettani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jabaad'a, aka wold'aqisa AABBO Waaqaani woliini tolfatani kaani indeene. Jecha isaa jabeesa, aka waan boch'ani kad'atani tokole ufii imid'aafanne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.12.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ebr 12.29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonti akanatiifi AABBO Waaqi keesani aka bobaa ibida jira; inni nama isaani morku inoobsu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato lafa suni keesati turtani ilmaanifi akhakhotale d'altani waan boch'ani kad'atani mid'aafattani inch'ubbamiina. wonti akanatiifi fuula AABBO Waaqa durati wonti kunini waan hamtu, ammalle isa dallansiifti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafafi gubbaleeni arra d'uga tiyya aka, hojja isani na d'ugefachu diddani, lafa ira hobaatani. Lafa Yordanini gama, ta isani diquma iti inqubatini taanile guddo keesa inteetani keesa isani balleesani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.28.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Qab-Ser 28.36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi gosa ch'ufa keesa gargari isani firfirse, aka fiigi keesani nama tatake tahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achiti isani waaqoota heddu harki namaa mid'aase, waaqa mukhatifi ka d'akha, ka wo arge yokhaani ind'ageenne ka wo nyaate yokhaani insuumne kad'attani hojattani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.29.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 29.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achiti isani AABBO Waaqa keesani barbaaddani duuba yo isani garaa tokooni barbaaddani, inuma gartani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo wonti hedduuni isaniti buute, gaargali isani qabate, isani eege AABBO Waaqa keesaniti deebitani d'ugeefatani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni Waaqa naasuti, isani lakise imballeesu, ammalle wold'aqisa inni abbooti teesani woliini tolfate kaani inded'u.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan dabre, ka gaafa isani ind'alatini, ka haga gaafa Waaqi nama lafati uume asi, lafa ch'ufa ke yaa, barbaada, laala. Wonti guddooni akana taka yayu taate? Nami tokoleeni taka waan akana kana yayu d'agaye? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami tokoleeni, ka Waaqa ibida keesa dubbate, aka isani d'ageetani kana d'agaye lubbu bulle injira? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waaqi tokoleeni, ka taka deeme nama lafa d'ibi keesaa fuud'e nama ufii tolfate, aka AABBO Waaqi keesani isani lafa Misiri keesaa fuud'e injira? Ila teesani durati inni irre isaatiifi jabeenna isaatini gaargala lolaatiini d'ufe, waan taka nami arge ind'agayinifi waan mama tolche, waan nama sodaachisa heddu tolche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.12.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 12.32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonti AABBO Waaqi waan kana ch'ufa isani garsiisefi, aka, isa male, waaqi d'ibiini injirre, isani garsiisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni qonqo isaa gubbaa isani d'ageesise, aka akasiini woi isaniti himu, lafa tana iraleti ibida isaa qulqullo isani garsiise ammalle ibida suni keesaa isaniini dubbate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan ababoota teesani jaalateefi inni isani fohate jabeenna isa guddaani lafa Misiri keesaa isani baase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato isani ga d'uftanu inni gosa jabdu irre qabdu taani jabeenna isaatini lafa tana keesaa isani duraa gusse, lafa isaani arrale teetani tana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanaafi arra inded'ina qaabad'a AABBO Waaqi Waaqa gubbatiifi lafale, isa male kad'ibini injiru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aadaafi seera isaa, ka anini arra isanii kenne kana ch'ufa d'ugeefad'a, duuba isanifi ilmaani teesanileeni nagayaani teetani. Ammalle isani lafa AABBO Waaqi keesani isani kennu tana haga jiru jireenna keesa teetani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dira heddu Yordanini ilaboru ka iti baqatani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.20.8+JOS.20.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 20.8-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Musani dira sadi ka Yordanini ilaboru kobaa baase, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka nami nama nyaapa isaa intahini danu ijeese iti baqate nagayaani achi tau. Nami sunini dandae dira kana tokoti baaqata, aka inijeemne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gosa Reubeni, dira Bizeri ka gooro lafa aloo gubba jiru, kennaniifi; gosa Gadi, dira Ramothi, ka lafa Gileadi keesa jiru, kennaniifi gosa Manasele, dira Golani, ka lafa Bashani keesa jiru, kennaniifi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka Seera Waaqa namaa kennani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musani Seera Waaqatifi barsiisa isaa gumi Israeliti kenne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafi inni seera kana kenneefi sunileeni eegi worri lafa Misiri keesaa bahe, bale galaana Yordanitini ilaboru jirtu, ta dira Beth-Peoritini gama jiru. Fullaani suni lafa hayyu Sioni, jed'ani ka gosa Amori ka dira Heshboni ke jirti. Hayyuuni suni ka duri Musafi gumiini Israeli, gaafa lafa Misiriti d'ufte dabsate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.45+DEU.4.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.45",
              "DEU.4.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri lafa isatifi lafa Ogu, hayyu Bashani, ka gosa Amori ta Yordanini ilaboru jirtu fud'ate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafti tunini haga dira Aroeri, ka afaani galaana Arnoni iraa baate, mirga, gaara Sirioni ka maqaani d'ibiini Amoriti ejite. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle lafti galaana Yordanitini ilaboru haga bitaa galaana sooda, ammalle ilaboru gula, haga hunda gaara Pisga ch'ufti, lafa sunini takaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.49"
            ]
          }
        }
